          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="opening-sequence__copy">
          <p class="opening-sequence__eyebrow">YOUNG MINISTERS RETREAT GLOBAL <span>·</span> TEN YEARS</p>
          <div class="opening-sequence__countdown"><span class="opening-sequence__countdown-label">THE REVIVAL BEGINS IN</span><Countdown /></div>
          <p class="opening-sequence__event">DECEMBER 26—30, 2026 <span>·</span> REDEMPTION CITY</p>
